WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:06.430
Rhonda would like to thank Rhea Coyne, Linnea Quigley, and Monique Gabrielle for a fabulous

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.400
Christmas.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.410
Didn't we have a great shopping mall?

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.270
Yes, we did.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.030
And I'd like to thank Playmates for letting our dreams come true tonight, and I'd like

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:18.050
to wish all of my fans a very, very Merry Christmas and a happy, healthy, prosperous

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.050
New Year.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.110
May all of your dreams come true.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:26.290
Now, Rhonda has a special coming up on New Year's Eve with Gilbert Gottfried.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.000
Yeah, well, a girl's got to do what a girl's got to do, but you make sure to

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.060
watch. And remember, if it's LA, it's Rhonda all night. Merry Christmas to all and to all a good

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:58.910
night. Nighty night. I'm not going anywhere. I'm going shopping.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:02.850
It's time.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.790
Rhonda, your cuddly couch companion, your bedtime buddy,

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:20.370
your friendly flirt, your Madonna of midnight,

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.670
and USA Up All Night continues with Dialing for Dingbats.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.480
Let's roll that puppy right now.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.500
employee and I bought my last three cars at Allen Ford and I got a doggone good

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.990
deal. I bought new and used cars from Ray Woodfield Ford and every one's been a

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:00.000
doggone good deal. We drove over 20 miles to

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.060
to Ray Whitfield Ford to get our new Aerostar.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.540
And it was worth the trip.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:05.710
Here, dog, come on, dog.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.310
Me and dog want you to go to Telegraph Road.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:13.320
Right now, get a good deal.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.370
Allen Ford, Telegraph North of Square Lake Road.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.750
Ray Whitfield Ford, Telegraph North of Goddard.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.160
You're watching Dialing for Dingbats on USA Up All Night.
